      "title": "What it reads, on your Mac only",
      "claims": [
        {
          "id": "no-credentials",
          "text": "It never reads the passwords, tokens or API keys your tools keep, or the tools' Keychain items. It reads only whether you're signed in, and as which account: its email and organisation.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/no_bare_tools.rs::no_sign_in_file_is_read",
