            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/scan.rs::scan_code_never_reads_credential_contents",
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/environment_scan_no_cli.rs::the_environment_scan_runs_no_vendor_cli",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/opencode_adapter.rs::the_sign_in_probe_reads_kinds_never_values",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/kimi_code_adapter.rs::the_sign_in_probe_reads_which_files_are_there_never_what_they_hold",
            "crates/juggler-adapters/tests/grok_build_adapter.rs::the_sign_in_probe_reads_modes_never_values"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "settings-parts",
          "text": "From Claude Code's settings.json it reads only the settings it needs, each one named in its code and checked.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/tests/no_bare_tools.rs::no_sign_in_file_is_read"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "native-crash-reports",
          "text": "With crash reports on, it looks through macOS's new crash reports for AI Juggler's own, and keeps only what failed and where.",
          "tests": [
            "crates/juggler-app/src/crash_native.rs::an_ips_crash_keeps_its_kind_and_frames_and_nothing_else",
